        "seg_cer": 0.111,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就严重地影响了身体健康。所以，科学减肥啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 9.612,
      "end": 14.37,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "是一个很重要的事情。那到底啷子才能够边吃这边瘦下来呢？",
      "score": 0.0183,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0039,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0051,
        "sc_delta": -0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.04,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "是一个很重要的事情。那到底啷子才能够边吃着边瘦下来呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.417,
      "end": 19.025,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "我们几个听一下的。健康有效的防治肥胖有哪一些呢？",
      "score": 0.6447,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5064,
        "sc_logprob": -0.501,
        "sc_delta": 0.0054,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.273,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我们先来听下子：健康有效的防治肥胖有哪些的？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 19.196,
      "end": 23.655,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "限制能量饮食，顾名思义啊，就是呢吃的少一点，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0069,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0067,
        "sc_delta": 0.0002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "限制能量饮食，顾名思义啊，就是呢，吃的少一点。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 23.655,
      "end": 26.536,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "造成能量的缺口。高蛋白饮食，",
      "score": 0.1355,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1334,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1866,
        "sc_delta": -0.0531,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.261,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "造成能量的缺口，高蛋白饮食。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 26.536,
      "end": 29.45,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "每天提高优质蛋白的摄入量。",
      "score": 0.0762,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0029,
        "sc_logprob": -0.003,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "每天提高油脂蛋白的摄入量。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 29.665,
      "end": 35.663,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "低血糖指数饮食，这一类食物呢具有低能量、高膳食纤维的特点。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0021,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0021,
        "sc_delta": 0.0,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "低血糖指数饮食这一类食物呢，具有低能量、高膳食纤维的特点。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 35.705,
      "end": 38.25,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "在我们平常的食物当中啊，比方讲，",
      "score": 0.0052,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0238,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0242,
        "sc_delta": -0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.01,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "在我们平常的食物当中啊，比方讲。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 38.25,
      "end": 42.456,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "你选点全谷物而不是精白米面来作为主食，",
      "score": 0.4277,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2447,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2344,
        "sc_delta": 0.0103,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.515,
        "seg_cer": 0.611,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "以训练选股，而不是惊爆秘密来作为主事。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 42.579,
      "end": 45.329,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "同时呢增加蔬菜、水果的摄入，",
      "score": 0.52,
